  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  featureName: "8000 m \u2013 Death Zone"
  informationText: <align=left>The oxygen concentration at this altitude is so low,
    your cells do not have enough oxygen to build new tissue. Your body will continually
    wither away until death.
